{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026xH8wEwVZfE1793447342.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>原中國石油化工集團公司董事長傅成玉，涉嫌嚴重違紀違法被調查。</p><p></p><p>中紀委國家監委網站通報傅成玉受查的消息，75歲的傅成玉是高級經濟師，從事石油工業40多年，曾先後在中國海洋石油有限公司、中國石油化工集團公司任職董事長等職務。他於2015年卸任，即退休超過10年後被查。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.OFFICIAL-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269xydaiwd901793447354.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:37.136110+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T11:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.797689+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.659924+00:00","content_hash":"59083dd261eca1afe3d6391b0d3914a0f470b8c2bfb659695dfd7fb73441a17d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:37.136110+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}